      "content": "i tried checking the router logs but it's all super confusing and i don't really know what i'm looking at. but even if it is a \"shared configuration\" thing, why would it only happen at 2am every single night? that doesn't sound like a power surge or a glitch, it sounds like a schedule. \n\nif they're using some kind of specialized software to bypass my new passwords, is there any way to look for \"unusual\" command structures? like, if i can find a log that shows a command coming in that doesn't match my usual routines, could that be evidence of them overriding the system? i'm starting to feel like if i don't find something concrete soon, i'm just going to look crazy to everyone else.",
